    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A crafted revelation from an artisan of truth exposed a system failure within the medical entrance exam process. The National Testing Agency, acting as a gatekeeper of assessment craft, received a tip-off containing PDFs that unmasked the flawed creation of the chemistry paper. This led to a referral for investigation initiation, resulting in the unmaking of the flawed artifact and the arrest of suspects, including an educator who had become a hypocrite. A re-crafting of the assessment is now scheduled.",
      "source": {
