    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The execution of a flawed script for the medical entrance exam was halted after an informant provided evidence of its corruption. The government organization responsible escalated the matter, leading to law enforcement action against thirteen accused individuals. This consequence revealed the collapse of the crafted system, necessitating a planned re-examination event to restore integrity.",
