    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "A tip-off from a source initiated a receipt of information that revealed the fabricated content within the entrance exam. The investigative agency's escalation exposed the corrupters of the system, resulting in arrests and the voidance of the original test. The consequence of this flawed initial design is a retest scheduled to correct the failure.",
